    {
      "name": "@local/file-tree-context-menu",
      "title": {
        "en": "File Tree Context Menu",
        "zh": "文件树右键菜单"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Right-click files or folders in the workspace file tree and deliverable lists to add them to the conversation, copy paths/links, preview in DSH, open in a terminal, summarize or explain with AI, create/rename/delete entries, or reveal them in the file manager.",
        "zh": "在工作区文件树与交付物列表中右键文件或文件夹：加入对话、复制路径/链接、在 DSH 中预览、在终端打开、用 AI 总结/解释、新建/重命名/删除，以及在文件管理器中定位。"
      },
